    {
      "id": "claim_da5038831ca84d3f94027c69a2211a01",
      "statement": "For an npm-only re-run (workflow_dispatch with npm_only=true), the workflow does not re-run goreleaser (to avoid colliding with the existing GitHub Release) and instead stages npm binaries by extracting them from the already-published, cosign-signed release zips and verifying their SHA256 against the release checksums.",
